Module
  name: client_mods
  description: Mod loader
  author: OTClient Team
  website: https://github.com/mehah/otclient
  sandboxed: true

  # Deliberately empty. Upstream shipped vBot 4.8 here (mods/game_bot) together
  # with its helpers client_profiles, game_buttons, game_itemselector and
  # client_textedit, and loaded all five from this list. That is a complete
  # automation suite: target selection, auto heal, auto attack, waypoint walking,
  # looting, and an eval surface of its own in executor.lua.
  #
  # Exp Arena scores runs and compares players, so brief section 1 puts Fair
  # first. A shipped bot is not compatible with that at any setting, which is why
  # the folders are deleted rather than disabled.
  #
  # This module itself has to stay: init.lua calls ensureModuleLoaded on it, and
  # that is fatal when the module is missing.
